msgstr ""

#: ../../../MergeFunctions.md:63
msgid ""
"This article consists of three parts. The first part explains pass "
"functionality on the top-level. The second part describes the comparison "
"procedure itself. The third part describes the merging process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MergeFunctions.md:67
msgid ""
"In every part, the author tries to put the contents in the top-down form. "
